\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S11}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Stored-pattern probe analysis.} (A)~$\beta ^*$ from stored-pattern entropy inflection vs.\ the value from the entropy-inflection search. (B)~Cross-similarity variance (stored probes) vs.\ random-probe variance. (C)~Variance ratio vs.\ $d$. (D)~The decomposition $\tau ^*_{\mathrm  {stored}}/\sigma _{\mathrm  {cross}}$ fails as a predictor ($R^2 = -9.0$). (E)~Self-similarity gap $\Delta $ vs.\ $d$. (F)~$\beta ^*$ vs.\ $1/\Delta $ ($r = 0.76$).}}{17}{figure.caption.29}\protected@file@percent }
